;A FEW SIDE CHAINS IN BOTH THROMBIN AND RECEPTOR PEPTIDE DO
NOT HAVE WELL-DEFINED ELECTRON DENSITY.  THESE ATOMS HAVE
BEEN GIVEN OCCUPANCIES OF 0.01 IN THE ENTRY.  IN ADDITION
RESIDUES ARG A 75, ARG A 126, AND GLN A 244 HAVE NO SIDE
CHAIN ATOMS AS THEY DO NOT HAVE ELECTRON DENSITY.
